        "zh": "星期天，兔子来了，找到了蜗牛。“来赛跑吧，不过我会赢。”兔子说。",
        "tip": "观察兔子开始比赛时的表情。",
        "alt": "星期天，兔子来了，找到了蜗牛。“来赛跑吧，不过我会赢。”兔子说。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0028/07.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "f961e027ad34911d2b693824a07b0d562dbfcfdf361625fdf0b5d74e8b875362",
        "imageWidth": 501,
        "imageHeight": 546,
        "audioFile": "audio/06-900ca2c5afc5073f.mp3",
