        "en": "Mother Sun decided to visit her sister, the moon. Sister Moon lives on the other side of the sky. \"I will be back soon,\" said Sun to the clouds.",
        "sourceText": "Mother Sun decided to visit her sister, the moon. Sister Moon lives on the other side of the sky. \"I will be back soon,\" said Sun to the clouds.",
        "zh": "太阳妈妈决定去看望她的妹妹月亮。月亮妹妹住在天空的另一边。“我很快回来。”太阳对云说。",
        "tip": "这是一个把天气当作家人的想象故事，找到太阳和月亮。",
        "alt": "太阳妈妈决定去看望她的妹妹月亮。月亮妹妹住在天空的另一边。“我很快回来。”太阳对云说。",
