        "en": "Goat, Dog, and Cow were great friends. One day they went on a journey in a taxi.",
        "sourceText": "Goat, Dog, and Cow were great friends. One day they went on a journey in a taxi.",
        "zh": "山羊、小狗和奶牛是好朋友。一天，他们乘出租车去旅行。",
        "tip": "指指三位乘客，和孩子说 taxi。",
        "alt": "山羊、小狗和奶牛是好朋友。一天，他们乘出租车去旅行。",
