        "en": "In my home village, there is a trader called Dembe.",
        "sourceText": "In my home village, there is a trader called Dembe.",
        "zh": "在我的家乡村庄里，有一位商人叫登贝。",
        "tip": "先认识故事里的登贝。",
        "alt": "在我的家乡村庄里，有一位商人叫登贝。",
