        "en": "The wind roars. It roars past our home.",
        "sourceText": "The wind roars. It roars past our home.",
        "zh": "风呼呼地吼，吹过我们家。",
        "tip": "轻轻模仿风声，听 wind。",
        "alt": "风呼呼地吼，吹过我们家。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0035/02.jpg",
