        "en": "Once upon a time there was a hungry jackal. He was walking around the bush looking for food.",
        "sourceText": "Once upon a time there was a hungry jackal. He was walking around the bush looking for food.",
        "zh": "从前有一只饥饿的胡狼，在灌木丛里四处找食物。",
        "tip": "指指胡狼，听 hungry。",
        "alt": "从前有一只饥饿的胡狼，在灌木丛里四处找食物。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0042/02.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "4bde3b22a8a9ae0c1c94ba3ea25131c73dffad2b05fc01a4e6df65d5bdf3ff19",
