        "tip": "看一看它离葡萄还有多远。",
        "alt": "葡萄太高了，胡狼没够着，摔了个仰面朝天。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0042/05.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "bb9d804ea0b8fac9e3ade1047376cc1216b5479e6d4cae6394ae1cd834e75dfd",
