        "en": "My name is Kobole. I live in a small village.",
        "sourceText": "My name is Kobole. I live in a small village.",
        "zh": "我叫科博勒，住在一个小村庄。",
        "tip": "先认识故事里的小朋友。",
        "alt": "我叫科博勒，住在一个小村庄。",
