        "en": "This is Agnes. She is my teacher.",
        "sourceText": "This is Agnes. She is my teacher.",
        "zh": "这是阿格尼斯，她是我的老师。",
        "tip": "指指老师，听 teacher。",
        "alt": "这是阿格尼斯，她是我的老师。",
