        "sourceText": "Agnes uses crutches to walk.",
        "zh": "阿格尼斯使用拐杖走路。",
        "tip": "平常地说：拐杖帮助她走路。",
        "alt": "阿格尼斯使用拐杖走路。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0160/03.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "581093d555ab5d1372145412bc9acc8cb08cfcc022ae40082ba8708217e460cd",
        "imageWidth": 546,
        "imageHeight": 546,
        "audioFile": "audio/02-3e15e8d0beb5c6b6.mp3",
