        "tip": "说一句：生气时也不能打人。",
        "alt": "鳄鱼冲进屋，用尾巴打小狗，小狗尖叫着跳出窗子。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0197/10.jpg",
