        "en": "The day that we've been talking about has come. We are going to play soccer. Chiefs versus Aces. Come and watch! Come with your vuvuzela!",
        "sourceText": "The day that we've been talking about has come. We are going to play soccer. Chiefs versus Aces. Come and watch! Come with your vuvuzela!",
        "zh": "大家一直谈论的日子到了！酋长队要和王牌队踢足球，快来观看，带上你的呜呜祖拉喇叭！",
        "tip": "找找足球，听 soccer。",
        "alt": "大家一直谈论的日子到了！酋长队要和王牌队踢足球，快来观看，带上你的呜呜祖拉喇叭！",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0198/02.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "4f36555b95407748d5951362520ee2c452a71dd937164350b40a5542f009f078",
