        "sourceText": "You played wonderfully, my beautiful Chiefs! You attacked wisely, you were careful, and you shared the ball. You played as a real team!",
        "zh": "你们踢得真好，我的酋长队！进攻聪明，小心又会传球，真正像一个团队！",
        "tip": "说说他们怎样互相帮助。",
        "alt": "你们踢得真好，我的酋长队！进攻聪明，小心又会传球，真正像一个团队！",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0198/05.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "8105f1a4289064c258857d1fb6d26e77f3b85800393a9d17e59f3bb8c340fc15",
