        "en": "It is nearly break time at Siyafunda Primary School. The two spaza shop owners at the school are preparing lunch to sell to hungry children.",
        "sourceText": "It is nearly break time at Siyafunda Primary School. The two spaza shop owners at the school are preparing lunch to sell to hungry children.",
        "zh": "西亚丰达小学快到休息时间，两位校内小店主正准备午餐，卖给饥饿的孩子们。",
        "tip": "先找到故事里的两家小店。",
        "alt": "西亚丰达小学快到休息时间，两位校内小店主正准备午餐，卖给饥饿的孩子们。",
