        "en": "I live in Kakuma village, a very hot dry place, full of thorny trees, and more goats than people. Even the market place is quiet, with only a few small shops. Most people use bicycles for transport.",
        "sourceText": "I live in Kakuma village, a very hot dry place, full of thorny trees, and more goats than people. Even the market place is quiet, with only a few small shops. Most people use bicycles for transport.",
        "zh": "我住在卡库马村，那里炎热干燥，长着带刺的树，山羊比人还多。市场也很安静，只有几家小店，大家大多骑自行车出行。",
        "tip": "看看村庄的交通和商店。",
        "alt": "我住在卡库马村，那里炎热干燥，长着带刺的树，山羊比人还多。市场也很安静，只有几家小店，大家大多骑自行车出行。",
        "sourceImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/asp-imagebank/a56e6dbe7aeeb8ea3e53d9941664416e2e7356ad/medium/0019/02.jpg",
        "sourceImageSha256": "7f3d21129798c41506ea3400b7c73eb91d6b41e674f71bf1a86c193e5d0eb441",
